<title>JAPAN: RESEARCH ALERT-Bridgestone Metalpha cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Bridgestone Metalpha cut.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nomura Securities Co Ltd said on Thursday that it had downgraded Bridgestone Metalpha Corp to a &quot;2&quot; rating from its previous &quot;1&quot;.</p>
<p>In its three-grade rating system, Nomura assigns a &quot;2&quot; rating to issues whosee values it sees moving within 10 percentage points in either direction of the key 225-share Nikkei average over 536870913 544499813</p>
</text>
